# Written by Release Please, never by hand, and it does not consult Prettier:
# `*` bullets and a blank line after each heading, where Prettier wants `-` and
# none. Formatting it is not a one-time cleanup — Release Please rewrites the
# whole file from the commit history on every run, so a formatted CHANGELOG
# comes back unformatted on the next release and fails `format:check` inside
# the one pull request whose merge ships the release. The generator owns the
# format of what it generates, the same reason `pnpm-lock.yaml` is above.
